.TH devin-models 1  "models " 
.SH NAME
devin\-models \- List the models available to your account
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdevin models\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
List the models available to your account
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
